<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Bidcorp to raise stake in Bidvest.</title>
<headline>Bidcorp to raise stake in Bidvest.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bid Corporation Ltd said on Friday it had raised 98.44 million rand through the placement of 7.8 million shares, equal to about 5.3 percent of issued share capital, at a price of 1,262 cents a share.</p>
<p>It said the cash will be used to increase Bidcorp's shareholding in the Bidvest Group Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
